1
00:00:00,068 --> 00:00:02,108
(Elizabeth:)I'm sorry, I'm rambling.

2
00:00:02,278 --> 00:00:03,908
(Leonard:)-Hi-lo.
SHELDON: Heh, heh.

3
00:00:04,823 --> 00:00:06,703
Hungry? Can I offer you anything?

4
00:00:06,908 --> 00:00:09,698
(Sheldon:)If anyone should offer her anything,
it should be me.

5
00:00:09,911 --> 00:00:11,581
(Sheldon:)Elizabeth, can I get you something?

6
00:00:11,746 --> 00:00:15,836
Perhaps a feminine-hygiene product
or a bowel-regulating yogurt?

7
00:00:16,459 --> 00:00:17,499
(Elizabeth:)Interesting choices.

8
00:00:17,669 --> 00:00:20,549
(Elizabeth:)Based on my current needs,
I guess I'd pick the yogurt.

9
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:21,795
(Sheldon:)Excellent.

10
00:00:21,965 --> 00:00:25,465
(Sheldon:)If the yogurt works, I bought
some delightful scented candles.

11
00:00:31,141 --> 00:00:32,271
(Leonard:)Look, it's you.

12
00:00:35,437 --> 00:00:37,897
(Elizabeth:)Thank you so much
for opening up your home to me.

13
00:00:38,106 --> 00:00:40,776
(Leonard:)Well, who wants to stay in a hotel?

14
00:00:40,942 --> 00:00:43,942
(Sheldon:)Windows that don't open,
those crazy card-shaped keys.

15
00:00:44,112 --> 00:00:46,072
(Elizabeth:)I'm so glad you understand.

16
00:00:46,281 --> 00:00:48,531
(Sheldon:)No, he doesn't understand.

17
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,780
(Sheldon:)-I understand.
-I understand too.

18
00:00:50,994 --> 00:00:53,454
(Sheldon:)You're just misappropriating
my understanding.

19
00:00:53,955 --> 00:00:55,245
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

20
00:00:56,082 --> 00:00:58,122
(Leonard:)I think any university would want you.

21
00:00:58,334 --> 00:01:00,714
Except any university
that already had you...

